"settings_safety_disclaimer" = "All compass, surveying, analysis, feng shui and related suggestions in this app are for information and entertainment only. They are not medical, architectural, structural, legal, financial or other professional advice. The app does not guarantee that results are accurate, complete, fit for a particular purpose or continuously available; sensor, AR, LiDAR, geomagnetic and algorithmic results must be verified on site. Do not use the app for navigation, emergency response, construction acceptance or personal safety decisions, and do not rely solely on it for renovation, construction, investment, relocation or other important decisions. Obtain the necessary rights for imported or captured content; minors should use the app with a guardian's consent and supervision. To the extent permitted by law, users assume losses resulting from actions based on the app, and the app and its developer accept no liability.";
"legal_terms_button" = "Terms of Use";
"legal_privacy_button" = "Privacy Notice";
"legal_terms_title" = "Terms of Use";
"legal_terms_body" = "1. Service scope\nThis app provides compass readings, sensor displays, AR and floor-plan surveying, traditional cultural analysis and related suggestions for information, learning and entertainment only. It is not medical, architectural, structural, engineering, legal, financial, investment or other professional advice.\n\n2. Measurement limits\nResults may be affected by device model, magnetic environment, permissions, lighting, occlusion, network or system state and user operation. AR, LiDAR, camera recognition and floor-plan inference may be inaccurate. Verify conditions on site and consult qualified professionals where appropriate.\n\n3. User responsibility\nDo not rely solely on this app for construction, structural changes, renovation, relocation, investment, medical care or other important decisions. Users assume all personal, property, construction, business and other losses resulting from actions taken on app content.\n\n4. Paid services\nIn-app purchases are processed by the Apple App Store. Subscriptions renew automatically for the period and price shown at purchase unless auto-renewal is turned off at least 24 hours before the current period ends. Manage or cancel subscriptions in Apple ID subscription settings. Refunds, billing and payment disputes are handled under Apple rules.\n\n5. Changes\nFeatures, algorithms, descriptions and paid entitlements may change with system, device or product updates. By using the app, you acknowledge this agreement; stop using the relevant features if you do not agree.";
"legal_privacy_title" = "Privacy Notice";
"legal_privacy_body" = "1. Data used\nWith permission, this app may use location, motion sensors, the magnetometer, camera and photo access for compass, magnetic declination, AR, floor-plan and photo-saving features.\n\n2. On-device processing\nIn the current version, camera frames, floor plans and AR/vision analysis are processed on the device. The app has no first-party server upload interface. Location, motion and magnetic data are mainly used for real-time calculations and display. Purchases are handled by Apple under its privacy policy.\n\n3. Photos and permissions\nPhoto access is used when you actively import, capture or save content. Saved items are controlled by you. You can change permissions in iOS Settings; related features may stop working when access is disabled.\n\n4. Local storage\nLanguage, compass preferences, purchase entitlement state and some settings may be stored locally in UserDefaults. Deleting the app or its data may remove this local information. Apple purchase records remain governed by your Apple account and the App Store.\n\n5. Updates\nIf future versions add servers, accounts, analytics or other data processing, this notice will be updated and required permissions or consent will be obtained. Contact support through the app listing for privacy questions.";
"legal_compliance_button" = "Compliance & Safety";
"legal_compliance_title" = "Compliance & Safety Notice";
"legal_compliance_body" = "1. Service scope\nThis app provides compass readings, magnetic and true-north conversion, AR scene tools, LiDAR/RoomPlan spatial surveying, floor-plan analysis, traditional cultural analysis and related suggestions. All results are for information, learning and entertainment only. They are not medical, architectural, structural, engineering, legal, financial, investment, navigation or other professional advice.\n\n2. Measurement and algorithm limits\nReadings and analysis may be affected by device model, sensor performance, magnetic interference, metal objects, electrical equipment, device attitude, permissions, lighting, occlusion, network and system state. Camera recognition, AR, LiDAR, RoomPlan, floor-plan recognition and bearing calculations may be inaccurate, delayed or unavailable. Twenty-four mountains, solar terms, magnetic declination and traditional metaphysics results are algorithmic estimates and are not guaranteed to be accurate, complete, real-time or suitable for a particular situation. Verify important conclusions on site and consult qualified professionals when needed.\n\n3. Prohibited or unsuitable uses\nDo not use this app for vehicle, marine, aviation or outdoor navigation; emergency response, fire safety, medical decisions, construction layout, load-bearing structure decisions, engineering acceptance, building safety assessment, land surveying or personal safety decisions. AR/LiDAR output cannot replace professional architectural, surveying, structural or fire-safety work.\n\n4. User responsibility and losses\nUsers must make independent judgments based on actual conditions, confirm permissions and sensor status, and remain responsible for renovation, construction, relocation, investment, business or other actions based on app content. To the extent permitted by law, users bear personal, property, construction, business and other losses caused by misunderstanding, misuse, device failure, environmental interference, algorithmic error or third-party service interruption.\n\n5. Content authorization and intellectual property\nBefore importing floor plans, photos, videos or other materials, users must have the necessary rights or permission. Do not infringe privacy, publicity, copyright, trade secrets or other rights. Reports and images generated by the app are for lawful personal use; do not use them for deceptive advertising, misleading others or unlawful activity without authorization.\n\n6. Permissions, privacy and on-device processing\nLocation, motion sensor, magnetometer, camera and photo permissions are requested only when the related feature is used. In the current version, camera frames, floor plans and AR/vision analysis are mainly processed on the device. Manage permissions in iOS Settings. Disabling a permission may disable related features; the app will not bypass system authorization.\n\n7. Third-party platforms and in-app purchases\nIn-app purchases are processed by the Apple App Store. Price, tax, availability, refunds, billing, subscription renewal and cancellation follow the purchase screen and Apple rules. Subscription management and restoration require the relevant Apple ID. Apple, iOS, ARKit, RoomPlan, Core Location and other system services are provided by their respective providers; the app does not guarantee continuous availability.\n\n8. Minors\nMinors should use the app with a guardian's consent and supervision. Guardians should help them understand measurement, payment and privacy risks. Do not collect, publish or distribute sensitive information about minors through the app.\n\n9. Updates and feedback\nFeatures, algorithms, permissions, paid entitlements and descriptions may change due to system, device, legal or product updates. If servers, accounts, analytics or other data processing are added, the privacy notice will be updated and required authorization obtained. Read the latest Terms of Use, Privacy Notice and this Compliance & Safety Notice before use. Contact support through the app listing for questions.";
